{"id":"e1959988c4da830e","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-branchcomplexity.md","title":"Decision-tree leaf bound","display":"thm-branchcomplexity — Decision-tree leaf bound","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-branchcomplexity","aliases":["27-thm-branchcomplexity"],"display":"thm-branchcomplexity — Decision-tree leaf bound","depends_on":["[[27-df-branch]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§2.5 binary enumeration framework; elementary full-tree count","source_printed_pages":"80–81","source_pdf_pages":"104–105","verification_status":"proved-in-note-for-explicit-full-tree-specialization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-branchcomplexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-branchcomplexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-branchcomplexity — Decision-tree leaf bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0021d62712fe298e\" href=\"?note=0021d62712fe298e\" title=\"27-df-branch\">27-df-branch</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.5 binary enumeration framework; elementary full-tree count"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"80–81"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"104–105"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-for-explicit-full-tree-specialization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:[n]\\to[n]\">\\(\\rho:[n]\\to[n]\\)</span> 为双射；带标签的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho)\">\\(\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0021d62712fe298e\" href=\"?note=0021d62712fe298e\" title=\"27-df-branch\">27-df-branch</a>。下式构造有限二叉树的语法载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_n\">\\(\\mathcal T_n\\)</span>，并在该载体上递归定义叶数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 和节点数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{n,0}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,b\\rangle\\mid b\\in\\mathbb B\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_{n,r+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_{n,r}\\cup\\{\\langle1,i,L,R\\rangle\\mid i\\in[n],\\ L,R\\in\\mathcal T_{n,r}\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal T_{n,r}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_{n,0}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,b\\rangle\\mid b\\in\\mathbb B\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_{n,r+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_{n,r}\\cup\\{\\langle1,i,L,R\\rangle\\mid i\\in[n],\\ L,R\\in\\mathcal T_{n,r}\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal T_{n,r}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\nu:\\mathcal T_n\\to\\mathbb N^+.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda,\\nu:\\mathcal T_n\\to\\mathbb N^+.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(\\langle0,b\\rangle)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\\nu(\\langle0,b\\rangle)\\coloneqq1\\quad(b\\in\\mathbb B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(\\langle0,b\\rangle)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\\nu(\\langle0,b\\rangle)\\coloneqq1\\quad(b\\in\\mathbb B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(\\langle1,i,L,R\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\lambda(L)+\\lambda(R),\\qquad\n\\nu(\\langle1,i,L,R\\rangle)\\coloneqq1+\\nu(L)+\\nu(R)\\quad(i\\in[n],\\ L,R\\in\\mathcal T_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(\\langle1,i,L,R\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\lambda(L)+\\lambda(R),\\qquad\n\\nu(\\langle1,i,L,R\\rangle)\\coloneqq1+\\nu(L)+\\nu(R)\\quad(i\\in[n],\\ L,R\\in\\mathcal T_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal T_n,\\qquad\\lambda(\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho))=2^n,\\qquad\\nu(\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho))=2^{n+1}-1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal T_n,\\qquad\\lambda(\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho))=2^n,\\qquad\\nu(\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho))=2^{n+1}-1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按剩余深度归纳得到满二叉树计数。若额外允许正确的常量剪枝，叶数/节点数相应变为不超过这些数；该优化未偷偷加入 Branch 的定义。旧定理允许未覆盖全部变量的次序，但旧构造此时并没有合法布尔叶。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-branch","status":"resolved","id":"0021d62712fe298e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-branch]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-branch","status":"resolved","id":"0021d62712fe298e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$\\rho:[n]\\to[n]$ 为双射；带标签的 $\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho)$ 见 [[27-df-branch]]。下式构造有限二叉树的语法载体 $\\mathcal T_n$，并在该载体上递归定义叶数 $\\lambda$ 和节点数 $\\nu$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:[n]\\to[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{n,0}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,b\\rangle\\mid b\\in\\mathbb B\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_{n,r+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_{n,r}\\cup\\{\\langle1,i,L,R\\rangle\\mid i\\in[n],\\ L,R\\in\\mathcal T_{n,r}\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\n\\mathcal T_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal T_{n,r}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda,\\nu:\\mathcal T_n\\to\\mathbb N^+.","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda(\\langle0,b\\rangle)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\\nu(\\langle0,b\\rangle)\\coloneqq1\\quad(b\\in\\mathbb B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda(\\langle1,i,L,R\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\lambda(L)+\\lambda(R),\\qquad\n\\nu(\\langle1,i,L,R\\rangle)\\coloneqq1+\\nu(L)+\\nu(R)\\quad(i\\in[n],\\ L,R\\in\\mathcal T_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal T_n,\\qquad\\lambda(\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho))=2^n,\\qquad\\nu(\\mathrm{Branch}(f,\\rho))=2^{n+1}-1.","display":true}],"bytes":2053,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-382","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-branchcomplexity|thm-branchcomplexity — Decision-tree leaf bound]]"}],"outgoing":["0021d62712fe298e"]}